<title>USA: Maxim Group to list on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Maxim Group to list on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>KENNESAW, Ga. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxim Group Inc said Monday it filed an application to list its common shares on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Maxim said the NYSE has informed it that it meets the eligibility requirements for listing. The company said it expects to begin trading on the NYSE on June 27, 1997 under the symbol &quot;MXG&quot;.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
